{"id":"39.4.3","doc":"T","title":"Functional Description","words":237,"blocks":[{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-39_4-1.png","alt":"Figure 39.4-1. Temperature Sensor Overview"},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"As shown in Figure 39.4-1, the "},{"t":"block","v":"temperature sensor","id":"temp-sensor"},{"t":"text","v":" can be started by software or by "},{"t":"block","v":"ULP","id":"ulp"},{"t":"text","v":" coprocessor:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Started by software, i.e. by CPU or ULP-RISC-V configuring related registers:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Set "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TSENS_POWER_UP_FORCE"},{"t":"text","v":" and "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TSENS_POWER_UP"},{"t":"text","v":" to enable the temperature sensor."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Set "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_FORCE_XPD_SAR"},{"t":"text","v":" to force "},{"t":"block","v":"SAR ADC","id":"adc"},{"t":"text","v":" power on, and set "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TSENS_CLK_EN"},{"t":"text","v":" to enable temperature sensor clock."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Wait for a while, then configure "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TSENS_DUMP_OUT"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The output value gradually approaches the actual temperature linearly as the measurement time increases."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Wait for "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TSENS_READY"},{"t":"text","v":", and read the conversion result from "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TSENS_OUT"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Started by ULP-FSM:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Clear "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TSENS_POWER_UP_FORCE"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ULP-FSM has a built-in instruction for temperature sampling."}]},{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Executing the instruction can easily complete temperature sampling, see "},{"t":"xref","id":"2","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Chapter 2"}]},{"t":"text","v":" ULP Coprocessor (ULP-FSM, ULP-RISC-V)."}]}]}]]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The actual temperature (°C) can be obtained by converting the output of temperature sensor via the following formula:"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"T(°C) = 0.4386 * VALUE – 27.88 * offset – 20.52"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":14,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"VALUE in the formula is the output of the temperature sensor, and the offset is determined by the temperature offset."}]},{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The temperature offset varies in different actual environment (the temperature range)."}]},{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For details, refer to Table 39.4-1."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 39.4-1. Temperature Measurement Range and Offset","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Temperature Measurement Range (°C)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Temperature Offset"}]],"rows":[{"n":17,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"50 ~ 125"}],[{"t":"text","v":"–2"}]]},{"n":18,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"20 ~ 100"}],[{"t":"text","v":"–1"}]]},{"n":19,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"–10 ~ 80"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":20,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"–30 ~ 50"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]},{"n":21,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"–40 ~ 20"}],[{"t":"text","v":"2"}]]}]}]}